{"2657210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kicking Brass", "steam_appid": 2657210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/5f75d2319a9933e819cb487b4544bb2a.avif?t=1775632691\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You have been arrested and sentenced to fight to the death in Emperor Brasshoven's musical Arena!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/338ac334598b947b2724b5b432469613.poster.avif?t=1775632691\" aria-label=\"A visual supercut, showing various animations and cutscenes from the game\" width=848 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/338ac334598b947b2724b5b432469613.webm?t=1775632691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/338ac334598b947b2724b5b432469613.mp4?t=1775632691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A whimsical world of music!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Based on the Tuba Knight memes, Kicking Brass is set in a world where music is literal magic. Every aspect of daily life is shaped by music: tools, clothing and weapons are replaced by instruments and those who can wield them are greatly admired. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/f40f699bedf2bd0fef7d110a19dbbd55.avif?t=1775632691\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wield different instruments!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In a world where weapons don't exist, instruments are your only defense. From Violins to Xylophones, each instrument grants you unique abilities and synergizes with other items in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Customize your run!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With close to 70 different items in game, no two runs are the same. You have an arsenal of instruments and accessories at your disposal, to make you an unstoppable fighting force. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/1c35f23515730678854f2f065bb58be9.poster.avif?t=1775632691\" aria-label=\"A gameplay supercut, showing the player purchase items from shops, attack enemies with instruments and fighting bosses\" width=848 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/1c35f23515730678854f2f065bb58be9.webm?t=1775632691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/1c35f23515730678854f2f065bb58be9.mp4?t=1775632691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Make friends and escape!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A wacky cast of characters reside in the Arena and are itching to escape before, they too, meet their end at the hands of Brasshoven's lackeys. Befriend them, scheme and execute your grand escape together!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/5f75d2319a9933e819cb487b4544bb2a.avif?t=1775632691\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You have been arrested and sentenced to fight to the death in Emperor Brasshoven's musical Arena!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/338ac334598b947b2724b5b432469613.poster.avif?t=1775632691\" aria-label=\"A visual supercut, showing various animations and cutscenes from the game\" width=848 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/338ac334598b947b2724b5b432469613.webm?t=1775632691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/338ac334598b947b2724b5b432469613.mp4?t=1775632691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A whimsical world of music!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Based on the Tuba Knight memes, Kicking Brass is set in a world where music is literal magic. Every aspect of daily life is shaped by music: tools, clothing and weapons are replaced by instruments and those who can wield them are greatly admired. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/f40f699bedf2bd0fef7d110a19dbbd55.avif?t=1775632691\" width=1560 height=163 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wield different instruments!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In a world where weapons don't exist, instruments are your only defense. From Violins to Xylophones, each instrument grants you unique abilities and synergizes with other items in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Customize your run!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With close to 70 different items in game, no two runs are the same. You have an arsenal of instruments and accessories at your disposal, to make you an unstoppable fighting force. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/1c35f23515730678854f2f065bb58be9.poster.avif?t=1775632691\" aria-label=\"A gameplay supercut, showing the player purchase items from shops, attack enemies with instruments and fighting bosses\" width=848 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/1c35f23515730678854f2f065bb58be9.webm?t=1775632691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/extras/1c35f23515730678854f2f065bb58be9.mp4?t=1775632691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Make friends and escape!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A wacky cast of characters reside in the Arena and are itching to escape before, they too, meet their end at the hands of Brasshoven's lackeys. Befriend them, scheme and execute your grand escape together!</p>", "short_description": "A third-person, bullet hell, prison break, boss rush roguelike. Choose an instrument as your weapon, talk to the tuba on your head, and die trying to escape the Arena over and over again!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/953ed92d91d03ffc73bb9b47339a16db5e5c181b/header.jpg?t=1775632691", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/46c25dbf4311c83ad388cbc69ec494f6b5b41817/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775632691", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/46c25dbf4311c83ad388cbc69ec494f6b5b41817/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775632691", "website": "https://stepheight.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "Copyright © 2022-2025 Stepheight Studio", "developers": ["Stepheight Studio"], "publishers": ["Stepheight Studio"], "demos": [{"appid": 2885310, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2657210/870c8bbf3c7dabcd5995029067fc7b5d08de7bd3/ss_870c8bbf3c7dabcd5995029067fc7b5d08de7bd3.600x